     id="desc1">10321 buses, 10320 branches, 1022 PV, 1020 BESS across 102 feeders. Panel (a) macro view; panel (b) feeder 100001 in full (101 buses, 10 PV, 10 BESS, 40 levels), the shape shared by 100 of 102 feeders.</desc>
